  message: "Fixed in PRs #2058 (1/sqrt(N) confidence scaling) and #2059 (inline method qualification + same-class preference + key-based path_hint matching). Inline methods now get qualified names, preventing registry collisions. Same-class preference uses enclosing class as path_hint. Remaining gap: cross-file disambiguation without type info."  # 07b6
